class: negative
summary: a function value whose parameter escapes into another, where its place's type says escaping, is refused naming that parameter as each side writes it
program: main.ldn
args: --target=linux-x86-64 ../tests/fixtures/negative/function-value-escaping-into-differs/main.ldn
codes: L0301
constructs: 1000, 0800
targets: linux-x86-64
expect: expected.txt
